    "cards": [
      {
        "id": "card-v4i653mtu0kaqt",
        "name": "写作任务",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 225,
        "color": "blue",
        "headVersionId": "version-kq7qk2mtu0kaqt",
        "versions": [
          {
            "id": "version-kq7qk2mtu0kaqt",
            "cardId": "card-v4i653mtu0kaqt",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 写给谁，留下什么\n\n读者：刚带项目的设计师。\n成果：一篇具体、平实的周复盘文章。\n\n不编造收益数据；用一个当天可做的小动作收尾。"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:9402a84a",
            "origin": "human",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.181Z"
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.181Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.181Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "card-d78ai0mtu0kaqv",
        "name": "素材边栏｜可以补充",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 290,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 250,
        "color": "yellow",
        "headVersionId": "version-z315mdmtu0kaqv",
        "versions": [
          {
            "id": "version-z315mdmtu0kaqv",
            "cardId": "card-d78ai0mtu0kaqv",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 手头的素材\n\n- 便签散在三处，周五靠回忆复盘\n- 按“未解决的问题”整理后更好找\n- 一次失败尝试比十条完成事项更值得写\n\n原创演示经历。"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:251ffa26",
            "origin": "human",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.183Z"
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.183Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.183Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "card-1ndo3dmtu0kaqz",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 640,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 355,
        "height": 300,
        "headVersionId": "version-xajl1dmtu0karg",
        "versions": [
          {
            "id": "version-xajl1dmtu0karg",
            "cardId": "card-1ndo3dmtu0kaqz",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 从散落便签到周复盘\n\n1. 从周五想不起发生过什么开始。\n2. 展示一条失败尝试的完整记录。\n3. 按问题归拢，不堆完成事项。\n4. 留下一个下周能验证的尝试。\n\n待补：具体项目例子。"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:804f8e4e",
            "origin": "ai",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.204Z",
            "sourceRunId": "run-1gln37mtu0karc"
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.187Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.204Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "card-ckshd3mtu0kaqz",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 640,
        "y": 470,
        "width": 355,
        "height": 350,
        "headVersionId": "version-o487timtu0kbe7",
        "versions": [
          {
            "id": "version-4g1pbtmtu0kb4w",
            "cardId": "card-ckshd3mtu0kaqz",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 不从空白开始复盘\n\n周五打开文档时，你是否也想不起这一周发生了什么？\n\n每天留一条便签：问题是什么、采取了什么动作、看到了什么结果。\n\n到周五，按问题把记录放在一起。不要急着把每个故事都写成成功。\n\n[补入一个你自己的失败尝试]\n\n今天先留下一条具体记录。"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:e32b362f",
            "origin": "ai",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.687Z",
            "sourceRunId": "run-0bw8rhmtu0kb4h"
          },
          {
            "id": "version-o487timtu0kbe7",
            "cardId": "card-ckshd3mtu0kaqz",
            "sequence": 2,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 那次复盘，我没有写出结论\n\n上周五，我翻了三处便签，才找到周二那次失败的尝试。\n\n它没有变成一个成功故事，但留下了一个值得继续试的问题。\n\n后来我开始记录：当时的问题、做过的动作，以及实际看到的结果。\n\n复盘不一定要立刻有结论。把还没想明白的事留下来也有价值。\n\n[补入自己的具体项目背景]"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:c12c4951",
            "origin": "human",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:11.023Z"
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:10.187Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:11.023Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "card-hbh3a6mtu0kaqz",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 1320,
        "y": 470,
        "width": 355,
        "height": 270,
        "headVersionId": "version-l2ecrimtu0kb7u",
        "versions": [
