      },
      {
        "id": "card-5chw3lmtu0kbds",
        "name": "编辑决定｜保留自己的声音",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 1320,
        "y": 0,
        "width": 355,
        "height": 280,
        "color": "red",
        "headVersionId": "version-giqnszmtu0kbds",
        "versions": [
          {
            "id": "version-giqnszmtu0kbds",
            "cardId": "card-5chw3lmtu0kbds",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 这轮改稿只做两件事\n\n1. 把反问开场换成亲身经历。\n2. 保留“失败不一定有结论”。\n\n不要写“只需三步就能高效复盘”。"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:b3da45e7",
            "origin": "human",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:11.008Z"
          }
        ],
